1. If notes[i] < notes[i + 1], then b_i < b_{i + 1}.  
2. If notes[i] > notes[i + 1], then b_i > b_{i + 1}.  
3. If notes[i] = notes[i + 1], then b_i ≠ b_{i + 1}.  
I will assign fingers 1–5 in order, and check each pair of adjacent notes.  
Answer: 
def solution(n, notes, out):;;
    b =(8) [1] * n ;;
    for i in range(1, n):;;
        if notes[i] < notes[i + 1]:;;
            if b[i] >= b[i + 1]:;;
                out["value"] = -1 ;;
                return ;;
        elif notes[i] > notes[i + 1]:;;
            if b[i] <= b[i + 1]:;;
                out["value"] = -1 ;;
