We need to split n balances into at most x per address, paying fee per transaction.  
1. Sort balances descending.  
2. For each i, if balances[i] > x, split into floor(balances[i]/x) + 1 groups of x.  
3. Total fee = sum of splits * fee.  
4. Return that total.

def solution(n, balances, x, fee, out):;;
    import helper ;;
    total =(8) 0 ;;
    for i in range(1, n + 1):;;
        if balances[i] > x:;;
            groups =(8) balances[i] // x + 1 ;;
            total =(8) total + groups ;;
    out["value"] = total * fee ;;
    return ;;
